  "title": "VideoAmp Adds Data From SiriusXM, National CineMedia to Audience Planning Tool",
  "summary": "National CineMedia is now integrated into VideoAmp's cross-platform media planning technology, marking the first time cinema has been included in a unified planning solution of this type. The integration enables advertisers to plan campaigns across streaming, CTV, digital video, audio, and cinema environments within a single framework, bringing NCM's moviegoer data from 17,000 screens across 1,300 theaters in 184 markets into cross-platform planning.",
